<title>JAPAN: Dai-Ichi Mutual 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Dai-Ichi Mutual 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	  (in billions yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Premium income		 3.89 trln   vs	    4.09 trln</p>
<p> Asset Invest Gains	   1.22 trln   vs	    1.21 trln</p>
<p> Insurance Payments	   3.68 trln   vs	    2.64 trln</p>
<p> Asset invest costs	 577.90	  vs	  468.10</p>
<p> Current			343.40	  vs	  220.60</p>
<p> Total assets		  28.03 trln   vs	   27.39 trln</p>
<p> Investment yield	     2.6%	  vs	   2.68%</p>
<p>NOTE - Dai-Ichi Mutual Life Insurance Co is a major life insurance company.</p>
